xactly as today.\n3. Add suite cases for both lengths and for one short body that is neither form. Each new check needs a planted mutant that fails it.\n4. Run every processor gate at base and head: `scripts/run_suites.sh`, `lint_hdl.sh`, `make check`, `gen_matrix.py --check` and `syn/yosys/run.sh` with the CI-pinned sv2v and Yosys. Run the parent consumer gates on a scratch parent at dev with the gitlink set to your head.\n5. STOP on any register-map, top-level port or parameter change.\n\nPost REVIEW READY or STOP here. Two reviewers follow, then the parent pin adoption.\n","author_association":"OWNER","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Mister-M-alt/protocol-processor-control-plane-avb-milan/issues/comments/6236134563/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Mister-M-alt/protocol-processor-control-plane-avb-milan/issues/comments/6236145831","html_url":"https://github.com/Mister-M-alt/protocol-processor-control-plane-avb-milan/issues/176#issuecomment-6236145831","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Mister-M-alt/protocol-processor-control-plane-avb-milan/issues/176","id":6236145831,"node_id":"IC_kwDOT06kyc8AAAABc7QIpw","user":{"login":"Mister-M-alt","id":161579364,"node_id":"U_kgDOCaGBZA","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/161579364?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Mister-M-alt","html_url":"https://github.com/Mister-M-alt","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Mister-M-alt/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Mister-M-alt/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Mister-M-alt/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Mister-M-alt/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Mister-M-alt/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/u